WEBVTT

00:05:29.097 --> 00:05:30.363
I was bad,

00:05:30.397 --> 00:05:32.930
I walked like Frankenstein,
I couldn't jump,

00:05:32.963 --> 00:05:35.497
I could hardly touch my toes
without bending my knees,

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:37.663
and I was afraid of heights.

00:05:37.663 --> 00:05:39.063
But I was determined.

00:05:39.863 --> 00:05:41.797
I stayed at the pool until it was dark,

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:44.263
and my coach kicked me
out of practice. (Laughs)

00:05:44.263 --> 00:05:48.530
I knew that the seeds of greatness
are planted in the daily grind,

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:51.297
and eventually, my hard work paid off.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:53.963
By my senior year,
I made the All-American list,

00:05:53.997 --> 00:05:57.197
and I qualified
for the Junior Olympic Nationals.

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:59.030
I was obsessed with diving.

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:02.630
It was more than something I did,
it became who I was.